OL,3,GNEWSAFuture model for water sector
OL,4,Adebated by MPs
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe future of the private companies
OL,7,Fthat run England's water industry has
OL,8,Fbeen debated in Westminster after more
OL,9,Fthan 200,000 people signed a petition
OL,10,Fcalling for change.
OL,12,FCreated by Oxfordshire-based Ash Smith,
OL,13,Ffrom Windrush Against Sewage Pollution,
OL,14,Fthe e-petition called for a national
OL,15,Freferendum on whether the water
OL,16,Findustry should be returned to public
OL,17,Fownership.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,340,330,200,160,0,100
