OL,3,GNEWSAFuture model for water sector
OL,4,Adebated by MPs
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe debate did not have the power to
OL,7,Fgrant a referendum, but did give MPs
OL,8,Fthe opportunity to put forward their
OL,9,Fopinions on the current ownership
OL,10,Fmodel.
OL,12,FThe water minister said the government
OL,13,Fwas "bringing in tougher regulation,
OL,14,Fstronger enforcement and greater
OL,15,Faccountability".
